    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 7 The Berkley presents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a beautifully maintained two-bedroom ground floor apartment in the highly regarded village of Newtownforbes, Co. Longford. Presented in excellent condition throughout, this attractive home offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation and is ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers, investors or those seeking a low-maintenance property in a convenient village setting.\n\nA management company is in place and oversee the regular maintenance of communal areas such as green spaces, pathways, lighting, parking areas and shared facilities allowing a more attractive and enjoyable living environment for all residents.\n \nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious kitchen/dining area with direct views over a private rear patio, creating a lovely space for everyday living and outdoor enjoyment. There are two comfortable bedrooms and a well-appointed main bathroom, all finished to a very good standard.\n\nThe property benefits from private parking within a secure gated community, providing peace of mind and a safe residential environment. Its superb location places it within easy walking distance of Newtownforbes village and its excellent range of local amenities, including shops, schools, cafés and community facilities. Longford Town is just a short drive away, while the nearby N4 offers excellent connectivity to Dublin, Sligo and the wider region.\n\nCombining comfort, convenience and security, this is a turnkey apartment in a sought-after location and early viewing is highly recommended.\n\nMangement Fee: Approx 1,500 per annum (including sinking fee)"
      },
